OL,3,GNEWSAVan driver, 36, dies in crash with
OL,4,Alorry in Aberdeenshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died in a crash between a van
OL,7,Fand a lorry in Aberdeenshire.
OL,9,FEmergency services including an air
OL,10,Fambulance were sent to the scene on the
OL,11,FA947, north of Fyvie, at about 13:30 on
OL,12,FThursday.
OL,14,FPolice have now confirmed that a
OL,15,F36-year-old man, who was driving a
OL,16,Fwhite Vauxhall van, was pronounced dead
OL,17,Fat the scene.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
