OL,3,GNEWSAVan driver, 36, dies in crash with
OL,4,Alorry in Aberdeenshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 33-year-old driver of a blue Volvo
OL,7,Fskip loader lorry was taken to hospital
OL,8,Ffor treatment. Police are appealing for
OL,9,Fwitnesses, including anyone with
OL,10,Fdashcam footage.
